{title: I Will Sing To You}
{artist: The Psalmist, C. Michael Pilato}
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 84}

Verse 1
[Gm]My heart is [Emmaj7]sure, O God.
[Gm]I am secure, [Emmaj7]O God.
[Bm]With everything my soul will sing [F]to You.
[Gm]I will awaken [Emmaj7]the dawn.

Chorus
[Em]Great are you, Lord; [Bm]higher than heavens.
[Fsus]Your faithfulness [Em]fills the skies.
Be exalted, O Lord, above [Bm]all the heavens
[Fsus]And let Your glory rise!

Verse 2
[Gm]You are a [Emmaj7]given, O God.
[Gm]You will deliver, [Emmaj7]O God.
[Bm]Salvation You bring, so my soul will sing [F]to You.
[Gm]I will awaken [Emmaj7]the dawn.

Chorus
[Em]Great are you, Lord; [Bm]higher than heavens.
[Fsus]Your faithfulness [Em]fills the skies.
Be exalted, O Lord, above [Bm]all the heavens
[Fsus]And let Your glory rise!

Verse 3
[Em]I [F/Em]will [Bm]sing to You.
[F]I will [Gm7]sing to You.
[Em]I [F/Em]will [Bm]praise You, O God, before [F]the world!
